{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Track24: Work Time Tracker 是一款工時與薪金追蹤工具，適合時薪工作、輪班員工、兼職及自由職業人士使用，可記錄上下班、輪班與加班時間，並按時薪自動計算收入。原價 US $39.99 的終生版現正限時免費，把握機會即可長期使用。</p>\n\n<h2>快速打卡自動計薪</h2>\n<p>打開應用即可快速打卡上下班，記錄輪班、休息與加班時間，並同時管理多份工作與不同時薪。系統按時薪自動計算收入，隨時查看每日、每週及每月的工時與薪金總額。所有記錄整理成清晰時間表，不必依賴試算表或手動計算，適合輪班工作、兼職及自由職業者使用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Track24: Work Time Tracker 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5718\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5718-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 5719\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IMG_5719-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Track24: Work Time Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T10:20:09.012983+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}